*.css text
*.js text
*.mjs text
*.json text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.txt text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
